- Content that infringes someone's copyright, trademark or privacy
- Spam, scams, malware or phishing
- Other people's personal data without their permission
{% if has.get("ai") %}
- Attempts to make AI features produce any of the above, or to get around their safety limits
{% endif %}

**Reporting:** use the "Report" button on the content, or email {{ contact_email }}. We review reports and may remove content, suspend accounts, and tell you why (you can appeal by replying).
